# Black: Thwap, the thwap bar: every black key a thwap on the steel, the left half on the left shoulder,
# the right half on the right, so a thwap sounds on the side of the fields beside it. Out from the ends:
# thwap, heel, fingers, closed, tak; in the middle, over the ding, the top and bottom of its field: the
# fundamental forward, and with the ding's keys, the fundamental alone.
# (params: 26 Black; hits: 0 thwap L 1 tak L 9 tak R 10 thwap R 15 heel L 16 fingers L 17 closed L
#  18 closed R 19 fingers R 20 heel R 28 field top 29 ding fund 30 field fund)
wav thwap.wav
wait 1600
tap SEL
expect view 7
spin K4 3
expect par26 3
key b0 down
wait 10
expect hitlast 0
expect shellL >5
shot thwap_bar.png
key b0 up
wait 400
tapkey b1
wait 30
expect hitlast 15
wait 400
tapkey b2
wait 30
expect hitlast 16
wait 400
tapkey b3
wait 30
expect hitlast 17
wait 400
tapkey b4
wait 30
expect hitlast 1
wait 400
tapkey b5
wait 30
expect hitlast 28
expect note5000 >5
wait 600
# a finger on the top (the middle key held), the ding struck: its fundamental alone; the field struck: the same
key b5 down
wait 30
tapkey w7
wait 30
expect hitlast 29
expect note5000 >5
wait 300
tapkey w9
wait 30
expect hitlast 30
key b5 up
wait 400
# a finger on the ding or the field, the top struck
key w8 down
wait 30
tapkey b5
wait 30
expect hitlast 30
key w8 up
key w6 down
wait 30
tapkey b5
wait 30
expect hitlast 30
key w6 up
# the other field held still closes it, the top held or not
key b5 down
key w6 down
wait 30
tapkey w9
wait 30
expect hitlast 23
key w6 up
key b5 up
wait 400
tapkey b6
wait 30
expect hitlast 9
wait 400
tapkey b7
wait 30
expect hitlast 18
wait 400
tapkey b8
wait 30
expect hitlast 19
wait 400
tapkey b9
wait 30
expect hitlast 20
wait 400
key b10 down
wait 10
expect hitlast 10
expect shellR >5
key b10 up
wait 400
# a thwap on the left, the field on the left: the same side
tapkey w3
tapkey b2
wait 30
expect hitlast 16
leds
# back to the kit
spin K4 -3
expect par26 0
tapkey b0
wait 30
expect hitlast 14
wait 1500
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.3
expect dropped 0
